WEBVTT

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:23.790
Your initials I wrote in my notebook

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:31.600
Discreetly overlapping so they won't be noticed

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.110
I stretched up

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:42.110
The school building I looked up at and the distant sky

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:53.690
The moon in broad daylight shows some restraint and lingers inside the light.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:01:01.310
I want these feelings to reach you

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:11.500
I embrace the small bud of passion that sprouted in my heart

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:18.170
Some day I want to make it bloom into a big flower

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:26.940
Our fluttering hearts connected, our eyes exchanging a glance

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:03.760
Everybody has that special day they'll never forget.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:14.090
I wonder if today will become my special day.

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:15.570
No, I have to make it so.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:18.910
I have to confess to her and put an end to two years of unrequited love.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:29.700
Oh, looks like you're getting psyched, Ichitaka.

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:31.830
Teratani...

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:34.380
Well, I understand that.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:37.420
You finally get to spend Christmas with Yoshizuki.

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:39.080
What do you mean "spend with"?

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:42.970
Morisaki, Iori-chan, you and I are having a part. That's all, right?

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:47.220
How long have we been friends?

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:52.040
You're planning on confessing to Yoshizuki tonight, right?

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:54.440
Well, if I get the chance...

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:57.740
All right! The first place we'll go to is a Karaoke box.

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:01.350
I'll ask Morisaki to disappear with me,

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:04.200
so you can spend a romantic Christmas Eve, alone with Yoshizuki.

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:07.600
Isn't that the best situation to confess your love?

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:09.590
But, still...

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:13.000
If she isn't interested in you, she wouldn't ask to spend Christmas together.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:16.130
Do you really think so?

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:19.960
The only problem is your contrary personality.

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:23.520
Just because you don't want her to realise your feelings...

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:26.060
...you end up being a jerk.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.600
Even little school kids wouldn't pull that kind of stunt any more.

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:36.280
Well, I get that being rejected by your first love before even confessing can be pretty traumatising,

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:38.480
but you need to get over it already.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.130
I know that.

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:42.910
Oh, come on! Have more confidence in yourself!

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:45.170
Think about how you were two years ago.

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:48.340
This would've been unimaginable back then!

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:53.880
He's right. This is like a miracle,

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.040
because, back then...

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:59.460
...all I did was watch her, quietly, from a distance.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:07.330
I couldn't even have imagined that I'd be comfortable talking to her as a friend.

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:24.110
You're one step away from being a stalker.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:34.520
Oh, can you really afford that cold attitude?

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:39.450
Even though I was kind enough to bring you a very special pin-up.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:42.790
It's just another cut and paste idol collage, isn't it?

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:44.340
Model shots of Yoshizuki!

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:50.270
Oh! The beautiful curve of the body!

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:52.920
The risqué angle!

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:54.560
It's driving me nuts!

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:02.150
You! This picture is?!

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:06.160
It's real. I came across it in a book store.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.720
But why is Iori-chan...?

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:09.660
I don't know,

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:13.790
but Yoshizuki never told anyone about it, and besides...

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.870
...I'm probably the only one who'd even know of a small time magazine like this.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.930
Hey, Ichitaka...

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:20.630
W-What are you trying to say?

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:23.530
Isn't this a great chance for you to talk to her?

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:26.640
Say something like, "They were pretty" or, "It was cute."

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:28.720
I can't do that...

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:32.140
All girls love to be praised.

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:35.280
I've never spoken a word to her.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:38.950
You're too cautious around girls.

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:42.070
You'll end up stuck as the "good friend,"

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:45.200
while you secretly adore her.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:48.630
Follow your animal instinct and knock her to the ground.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:52.440
Stop with the weird thoughts. You're corrupting her.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.410
Yet you're still taking the magazine...

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:04.260
Unless a miracle happens, I'll never be able to get close to her.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:13.350
All right! The representatives from our class are Yoshizuki and Seto.

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:18.160
You have to come up with some ideas for live entertainment.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:21.360
With that in mind, do your best to think of something.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:35.370
This is a difficult job, isn't it?

00:06:36.530 --> 00:06:37.430
Yeah.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.440
Hey, Seto-kun.

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:41.080
What?

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:44.300
Maybe we should sit a little closer...

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:47.370
I-I'm fine right here.

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:14.740
Um, do you have any pencil lead...?

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:26.740
Hey, Seto-kun, do you have any good ideas, for the Welcome Party entertainment?

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:29.880
What about you?

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:35.080
Sorry, I haven't come up with anything yet.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:59.490
I'm sorry. I have to go now.

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:02.210
I only have an hour off from drama club.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:05.040
Oh... okay.

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:14.380
Seto-kun, aren't you going home?

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:16.760
No. I'll try to come up with some ideas.

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:32.010
I'S?

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:36.370
I took both of our initials and came up with "Team I'S."

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:40.370
What do you think of the name?

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:44.210
You might not like having to work with me, but...

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:46.460
...let's at least try to enjoy doing this together.

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:57.350
Team I'S...

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.470
Show us your panties, Iori-chan!

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:11.340
You can wear a swimsuit! How about a teeny-weeny bikini show?

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:13.440
Hey you! Don't be a prude!

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.780
I know you love guys!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:19.120
She has that sexy body! Of course she loves it.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.620
Iori, can I do it with you? Just once?

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.350
I'm next!

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:24.620
Come on, I'm next!

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:34.070
Are they starting the strip tease show?

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:36.020
Strip! Strip!

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:41.110
Strip! Strip! Strip! Strip! Strip! Strip! Strip!

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:44.350
You posed for that magazine because you like to turn guys on, right?

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:49.310
That's enough, you idiots!

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.940
What do you think you guys are doing?!

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:57.110
What? Uh? Huh?

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:59.160
What the hell?

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:03.870
Hey! You're that guy who's always staring from across the building!

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:09.080
No, I'm just...

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.980
If you ever bother Yoshizuki again, I'll beat you senseless!

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:21.470
One more...

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:23.460
Why don't you cheer up already?

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:25.360
Just let me drink.

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:28.050
I'll explain everything to Yoshizuki tomorrow.

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:30.670
You'll just make me look more suspicious.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:32.040
Oh, please...

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:42.550
Here's some medicine to lift your spirits.

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:46.540
How did you get this?

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.150
Look at it carefully.

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:49.860
It's just an idol collage.

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:50.540
An idol collage?!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:52.540
It's a composite fake photo.

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:57.240
Anyone can make something like this with a computer.

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:59.700
You scum! How can you give this to me now?

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.920
Give it back to me if you don't want it.

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:06.180
I accept it with my humble thanks.

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:09.940
You pervert! You finally showed your true colours!

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:12.580
Ichitaka?

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:22.540
I may not be that different from those guys teasing Iori-chan after all...

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:26.400
You can't even take a little joke like that.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:28.120
You really are down.

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:30.810
Cheer up, man.

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:32.670
I'll put your lucky charm here.

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:38.360
Anyway, you better talk to her tomorrow.

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:42.080
It's not as easy as you think.

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:45.270
But you shouldn't leave it as a misunderstanding.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:55.260
Iori-chan...

00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:57.440
Yoshizuki is one tough girl.

00:11:57.830 --> 00:12:01.210
She doesn't let things get her down like you do.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:03.200
Yoshizuki!

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.460
Ichitaka has something to tell you.

00:12:05.460 --> 00:12:07.210
Hey! Stop it!

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:09.950
What is it?

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:23.190
About the heckling yesterday...

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:26.560
It... It wasn't me, okay?

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:29.350
I know that. It wasn't your voice.

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:31.310
Is that all?

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:34.060
Yes.

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.840
Can I ask you something?

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:46.540
I heard "That's enough, you idiots!" Was it you?

00:12:48.360 --> 00:12:49.480
Got a problem with that?

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:53.420
Really? That's what I thought.

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:58.460
You didn't seem to like me so... I thought it was kind of strange.

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:03.300
But those words saved me.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:05.260
Thank you.

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:08.800
D-Don't worry about it.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:16.480
I really didn't want to do that photo shoot.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.160
My club president asked me to do it as a good way to promote our drama club.

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:23.090
If I had known I had to wear a swimsuit,

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:25.200
I'd have never agreed to it.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:32.410
Hey...

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:36.440
Did you come up with any ideas?

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:38.920
No, nothing very good...

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:40.330
Let me see.

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:42.030
Sure.

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:03.090
Uh? Well, I...

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:04.730
You looked, didn't you?

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:09.070
It's not that I looked. It just sort of happened to be in my sight.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.670
What's this photo?

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:31.210
It's... I mean... My friend, Teratani, made it on his own...

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:49.540
Did you see that?

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:51.630
Yeah. The teddy bear...

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:54.840
Luck is smiling upon us, Ichitaka!

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:56.010
Are you an idiot?

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:59.120
What's wrong with you? Can't you just enjoy your good fortune?

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:02.610
I'm already a senior. Why should I be happy about that?

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:06.130
Hmph! I knew your eyes were stuck on it.

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:08.240
Stop saying things to ruin my reputation.

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:09.820
I was just surprised!

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:13.550
No, your <i>eyes</i> didn't look like they were surprised.

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:15.680
Whatever you say!

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:19.960
Thinking back to that time...

00:15:20.740 --> 00:15:23.840
Iori-chan seriously misunderstood me.

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:26.970
Congratulations on your nomination to be Miss Wanda High!

00:15:26.970 --> 00:15:28.410
Congratulations!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:33.200
We've decided to have a beauty pageant...

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.030
...for the New Student Welcome Party.

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:38.330
We really want you to participate as a contestant in the pageant.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:42.540
I'm sorry, but I'm not interested.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.510
We're begging you!

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:47.550
We're just getting pictures of the nominees.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.830
Please! I'm begging you.

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:51.570
I'm really not interested.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:52.550
Please don't say that.

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:54.550
Please help us!

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:04.840
She just got in. Today's main event!

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:09.320
All right! They're see-through!

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.650
Look the other way for the next one.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.510
Why should I?

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:16.490
Seeing Iori nude is too good for you.

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:18.310
Yoshizuki...

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.500
This is bad!

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:26.500
Can you step up over there and give me a pose?

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.430
Um, a swimsuit?

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:31.020
Yes. It makes the pageant more interesting.

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:32.510
I don't think I can do this.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.660
You can't say that now!

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:35.820
But, I...

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:37.900
Think of it as doing us a favour!

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:40.220
Please! I beg you!

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:47.070
What's wrong? Take it off already.

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:01.870
Well, well! Starting from there?

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.590
Ichitaka! Yoshizuki's in serious trouble!

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:13.590
Out of the way! Let me through!

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.940
All right! Bend over just like that!

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.950
Now they're bound to pop out!

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:35.420
She moved out of frame!

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:37.030
Don't blame me!

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.090
All right!

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:59.340
Huh? Aren't you going to get changed?

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:00.810
No.

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:03.970
I prefer changing rooms that don't have hidden cameras.

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.870
Hey, everybody wait!

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:10.480
You!

00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:13.020
I didn't ask you to do that.

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:14.920
Let me go.

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:18.050
Don't be silly.

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:20.140
The main event has just begun.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:22.010
Hey, don't let anybody in here.

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:23.520
Make sure we trade places later!

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:24.740
Got it!

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:33.750
Do you think you're some kind of hero? You stupid twerp!

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:38.940
Hey, what's going on?

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:40.260
Let's get out of here!

00:18:46.030 --> 00:18:48.560
Ichitaka! Are you all right?

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.730
I'm okay. Go find Iori-chan!

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:01.880
Yoshizuki, are you all right?

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:07.210
What's going on? Where is the fire?

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:11.620
I'm sorry. I accidentally set off the fire alarm.

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:14.570
We were just fooling around and accidentally hit the fire alarm switch.

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:17.180
What do you think you guys are doing?

00:19:17.180 --> 00:19:18.500
Be more careful!

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:19.760
Sorry, sir.

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:24.120
I guess we made it.

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:33.790
Those guys are really awful.

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:37.380
You guys are just like them.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:51.580
Wait.

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:54.700
We aren't the same.

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:01.440
We're nothing like them! Don't lump us in with those scumbags!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:04.880
We were trying to save you!

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:06.810
Why don't you get it?!

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:10.310
I'll quit the committee already!

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:20.120
Yoshizuki...

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:31.950
Seto, have you got a plan for the New Student Welcome Party?

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:34.260
Sensei, about that...

00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:37.160
I knew you didn't. Follow me!

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.830
Ninin-baori act?

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:45.800
A brilliant idea, right?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:47.930
I've also prepared the props.

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:49.550
But, we've already...

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:51.810
Don't mumble and just try it!

00:20:57.840 --> 00:21:01.320
Okay! You guys got that? Do it the way I just explained.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.220
Here we go.

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:19.200
I'm sorry.

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:21.310
It's all right. Don't worry about it.

00:21:21.310 --> 00:21:24.670
No, I really want to apologise.

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:28.640
Teratani-kun told me everything.

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:31.460
I'm sorry that I misunderstood you.

00:21:50.190 --> 00:21:51.630
I'm sorry.

00:21:51.630 --> 00:21:53.700
That's all right.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:09.290
A fan?

00:22:09.290 --> 00:22:13.310
Yes, because it's a necessary item to perform a Ninin-baori act.

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:15.820
I think using it makes our performance more authentic.

00:22:15.820 --> 00:22:18.310
So, I'm planning to buy one tomorrow.

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:23.210
Do you want me to go with you?

00:22:23.210 --> 00:22:24.820
Really?!

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:29.180
I thought it'd be better to decide together in case we have a different tastes!

00:22:29.180 --> 00:22:30.570
I'm so glad!

00:22:31.300 --> 00:22:33.030
Good morning, Iori!

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:34.900
Good morning!

00:22:34.900 --> 00:22:39.640
Seto-kun, let's discuss later where and what time we should meet tomorrow.

00:22:42.410 --> 00:22:43.660
A date...

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:47.220
We're going on a date!

00:22:53.020 --> 00:22:56.160
I don't want to look overdressed...

00:22:56.160 --> 00:22:58.430
...but I don't want to look too casual.

00:22:58.430 --> 00:23:01.700
Ah! I don't know what to wear!

00:23:03.460 --> 00:23:05.600
My! What's going on?

00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:07.230
Why are there clothes everywhere?

00:23:07.230 --> 00:23:09.320
Hey! Don't just barge in like that!

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:12.510
We're expecting an <i>extra</i> special guest tomorrow.

00:23:12.510 --> 00:23:14.060
Oh, really.

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:15.370
You don't want to know?

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:19.350
I'm busy right now. Hurry up and get out!

00:23:22.340 --> 00:23:24.710
What am I going to do?

00:23:37.670 --> 00:23:41.390
Damn it... I'm late!

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:45.270
Mum! Somebody's ringing the door bell!

00:23:46.270 --> 00:23:48.280
Hey, aren't you there?!

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:52.950
Who the heck is it? Stop ringing already!

00:23:56.110 --> 00:23:58.830
You are late. I've waited an hour for you.

00:24:02.050 --> 00:24:05.810
I'm sorry. Seriously! I accidentally overslept.

00:24:06.740 --> 00:24:09.470
I'll make this up to you, I promise!

00:24:11.390 --> 00:24:12.860
That's a surprise.

00:24:14.190 --> 00:24:17.470
I didn't think you'd make a big deal out of it.

00:24:18.660 --> 00:24:23.350
I said something mean the other day, so let's call it even.

00:24:23.350 --> 00:24:24.920
Yoshizuki...

00:24:25.810 --> 00:24:27.870
But I'm glad...

00:24:29.670 --> 00:24:32.570
I finally got to talk to you normally.

00:24:44.040 --> 00:24:47.010
This girl... is she your girlfriend?

00:24:47.010 --> 00:24:51.300
Huh? She's just my childhood friend.

00:24:51.300 --> 00:24:56.620
But you still have her picture. She must be important to you.

00:24:56.620 --> 00:24:58.410
It's not what you think.

00:24:58.410 --> 00:25:02.430
Besides, she moved to America five years ago.

00:25:02.430 --> 00:25:04.140
I haven't been in touch with her since then.

00:25:05.370 --> 00:25:06.820
I see.

00:25:06.820 --> 00:25:08.350
And besides...

00:25:08.350 --> 00:25:11.950
...the most important person to me right now is-

00:25:11.950 --> 00:25:14.650
Oh, I almost forgot!

00:25:16.360 --> 00:25:19.400
Donuts! I wanted to eat them with you.

00:25:20.400 --> 00:25:21.950
Thank you...

00:25:24.630 --> 00:25:28.020
I'm out of both coffee and tea.

00:25:28.020 --> 00:25:29.710
Is canned coffee all right with you?

00:25:29.710 --> 00:25:32.600
I'll quickly run to the vending machine and get it.

00:25:32.600 --> 00:25:34.510
Oh, I'll go then.

00:25:34.830 --> 00:25:35.530
But...

00:25:35.530 --> 00:25:37.740
It's okay. Don't worry about it.

00:25:37.740 --> 00:25:40.170
Why don't you fix your hair first?

00:25:47.630 --> 00:25:49.570
Don't let the tension get to you!

00:25:49.570 --> 00:25:53.110
Calm down and confess your feelings clearly.

00:26:10.130 --> 00:26:12.880
Oh, excuse me...

00:26:15.220 --> 00:26:16.240
Who...

00:26:17.560 --> 00:26:20.470
...was that girl... just now?

00:26:20.470 --> 00:26:23.470
Icchan? Is that you? It's been so long!

00:26:25.980 --> 00:26:27.480
Icchan?!

00:26:27.480 --> 00:26:30.440
Who the heck is this girl?!

00:26:35.470 --> 00:26:43.120
The worn-out diary

00:26:43.120 --> 00:26:50.760
I left behind in a corner of the classroom

00:26:50.760 --> 00:26:59.200
I closed it softly. I hold this throbbing in my heart

00:26:59.200 --> 00:27:10.000
In both hands and warm it up

00:27:10.000 --> 00:27:17.240
Since that day I met you by chance,

00:27:17.240 --> 00:27:24.900
I've grown small wings

00:27:24.900 --> 00:27:32.290
I felt your kind gaze,

00:27:32.290 --> 00:27:40.260
And even now I have a feeling I could fly into the sky

00:27:40.260 --> 00:27:43.850
Staring eyes and eyes
